  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposal is unacceptable on the grounds that there was no sufficient reasoning submitted to justify the loss of a community healthcare facility. The submision did not demonstrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;that (1) the loss of the facility in question would not create, or add to, a shortfall in provision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;for this specific type of social or community infrastructure in the borough, (2) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;that there is no demand for any other suitable social infrastructure use&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;on the site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In the absence of acceptable\r\njustification, the development may result in having a detrimental impact\r\naccess to a communal healthcare facility which is contrary to policy 45 of Waltham Forests&#x27; LP1 (2024) and policy S2 of the London Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
